OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,FA teenager charged over a small boat
OL,7,FChannel crossing was allegedly
OL,8,Fpiloting a "mega dinghy" carrying a
OL,9,Frecord 165 migrants from France to
OL,10,FEngland, the National Crime Agency has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FSudanese national Chan Mathok Atak,
OL,14,F19, is accused of endangering another
OL,15,Fduring a journey by sea to the UK on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FAtak, from South Sudan, has been
OL,19,Fremanded in custody and will appear at
OL,20,FMargate Magistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,26,@pD@LOUpD@XO]
