CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,FThe number of people aboard the vessel
OL,7,Fbroke the previous record set in July
OL,8,Fwhen 128 people crossed from France to
OL,9,Fthe UK in one boat.
OL,11,FBorder Security Command was pictured
OL,12,Fby the Press Association towing the
OL,13,Fboat ` dubbed a "mega dinghy" by the
OL,14,Fmedia ` when it arrived in Dover on
OL,15,FThursday afternoon.
OL,17,FIt was estimated to be about 13m
OL,18,F(42ft) long ` the same length as a
OL,19,Fstandard bus.
OL,26,@uD@QOUuD@]O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
