FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,FRefugee charity Care4Calais said the
OL,7,Fcrossing route is becoming "more and
OL,8,Fmore dangerous" because of the
OL,9,Fincreasing number of people in each
OL,10,Fboat.
OL,12,FSydney Sopher, the charity's chief
OL,13,Foperations officer, said: "The UK and
OL,14,FFrench governments have spent years
OL,15,Ffocusing on border security and
OL,16,Fenforcement, yet all they've achieved
OL,17,Fis to make Channel crossings more and
OL,18,Fmore dangerous.
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@OO]uD@[OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,F"The data shows that the average
OL,7,Fnumber of people crossing on single
OL,8,Fboats has been increasing year on
OL,9,Fyear, but it could all be stopped
OL,10,Fovernight by opening safe routes.
OL,12,F"That the Government continues to
OL,13,Fignore the unequivocal evidence that
OL,14,Fsafe routes work is a political choice
OL,15,Fthat prioritises the demonisation of
OL,16,Frefugees over compassion."
OL,18,FHome Office figures show 366 people
OL,19,Farrived after crossing in three boats
OL,20,Fon Thursday during warm, sunny weather
OL,21,Fand calm conditions at sea.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
