FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,FThe UK Coastguard said Border Force
OL,7,Fvessels, along with a UK Coastguard
OL,8,Faeroplane and the RNLI Dungeness
OL,9,Flifeboat, responded to "small boats
OL,10,Factivity" in the Channel on Thursday
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,13,FSome 172 people made the journey in
OL,14,Fthree boats on Wednesday, bringing an
OL,15,Fend to an 11-day hiatus when wind
OL,16,Fswept the Channel.
OL,18,FThese were the first crossings since
OL,19,FAndy Burnham became Prime Minister.
OL,26,@qD@XOUrD@IO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
