FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785138481
OL,3,CTeenager accused over Channel crossing
OL,4,C'was piloting mega dinghy'
OL,6,FPress Association analysis of
OL,7,FGovernment data shows 77,183 migrants
OL,8,Farrived in the UK after crossing the
OL,9,FChannel during Sir Keir Starmer's
OL,10,Fpremiership from Labour's election
OL,11,Fvictory in July 2024.
OL,13,FAccording to Home Office figures,
OL,14,F13,007 arrivals have been recorded
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,17,FThis is 45% lower than the number
OL,18,Frecorded by this time last year and
OL,19,Fdown 18% on the same period in 2024.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
